fixture pogo_keeps_horizontal
doc BUILD.md s5 Pogo: "Momentum: Horizontal speed fully preserved; vertical replaced"; s15 "Pogo keeps full horizontal speed"
room test/spikes
spawn 200 544
frames 80
input
  0..9 R
  10..30 R jump
  31..39 R
  40..79 D R attack
end
expect
  at 9 vx=2304
  mark bounce 40..79 event.pogo=1
  at bounce vx=2304 vy=-3388
  during bounce..bounce+10 vx=2304
  never 0..79 event.hazard=1
end
